    excerpt: 'A heartfelt poem about Heidi, a beloved German Shepherd, written by Barbara Bidwell.',
    content: '## "Heidi" by Barbara Bidwell\n\nHeidi Is My German Shepherd,\nShe\'s a big but gentle dog,\nshe loves to romp and play with me,\nand chews on every log.\n\nShe\'ll lay her head upon my lap,\nand roll her eyes to me,\ntrusting that I\'ll care for her,\nthat with me she\'ll always be.\n\nWhen I Get home from school each day,\nShe\'s waiting there for me,\nknowing that we\'ll run and play,\nand for a time be free.\n\nShe loves to run beneath the hose,\nas I spray it in the air,\nshe runs and jumps and snaps at it,\njust like a polar bear.\n\nIn the winter we have snowball fights,\nI throw the snow and then,\nShe leaps rear high and catches it,\nthen I do it all again.\n\nHeidi is so beautiful,\nand so very smart,\nbut most of all, "I love Her,"\n\n— And with her I will never part.\n\n## About This Poem\n\nThis poem was written by Barbara Bidwell about her beloved German Shepherd, Heidi. It captures the special bond between a young person and their dog — the loyalty, the playfulness, and the unconditional love that makes dogs such cherished members of the family.\n\nAt Trimming Edge, we are a family-owned and operated business, and family — including our four-legged family members — is at the heart of everything we do. We offer pet-friendly landscaping services throughout Western Massachusetts to ensure that your outdoor spaces are safe and enjoyable for every member of your family.\n\nOur pet-friendly landscaping services include:\n\n- Pet-safe lawn care products and treatments\n- Durable, pet-resistant landscape features\n- Designated pet areas within the landscape\n- Non-toxic plant selections safe for dogs and cats\n- Repair and maintenance of pet-damaged lawn areas\n\nContact Trimming Edge at (413) 551-9653 to learn more about our pet-friendly landscaping services in Western Massachusetts.\n\n## The Bidwell Family and Trimming Edge\n\nTrimming Edge was founded by David and Amanda Bidwell with a simple vision: to provide Western Massachusetts homeowners and businesses with the highest quality landscaping services, delivered with integrity and a personal touch. The Bidwell family\'s love of nature, animals, and community is reflected in everything we do.\n\nFrom Barbara\'s heartfelt poem about Heidi to David and Amanda\'s dedication to their clients and community, the Bidwell family brings genuine care and passion to all of their endeavors. We are grateful for the trust and support of our community, and we look forward to continuing to serve Western Massachusetts for many years to come.\n\nTo learn more about the Bidwell family and Trimming Edge, visit our About page or contact us at (413) 551-9653.',
